# No billable cloud actions

Do not create, scale, deploy, or purchase paid Azure or Cloudflare resources via MCP or shell without the user explicitly accepting billing in the same message.

Allowed: read-only discovery, local dev, drafting IaC in the repo without apply.

Forbidden without explicit approval: `az deployment`, `terraform apply`, `wrangler deploy`, plan upgrades, paid SKUs, production-scale usage.

When cost is unclear, stop and ask.